  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The other side falls silent. You hear Sydney shift on the bench. "B-beloved?" <<he>> whispers. "I know that voice."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      另一侧安静下来。你听见悉尼在长椅上动了动。“挚、挚爱？”<<he>>低声问道，“我认得这个声音。”
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<getinicon>>
