:: Temple Confess Self Sydney Cross []
<<set $outside to 0>>
<<set $location to 'temple'>>
<<temple_effects>>
<<effects>>
<<npc Sydney>>
<<person1>>
<<run statusCheck('Sydney')>>

<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You leave your own compartment and quietly close its heavy door. After checking that the corridor is empty, you open the other door
    and enter the confessor's side where Sydney is waiting.
    <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
      Sydney locks the door behind you, then pulls you down onto the narrow bench. "You came all the way around just to tempt your confessor?" <<He>>
        grins, slipping a hand beneath your clothes. "Go on, beloved. Lay the rest of your sins bare."
    <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
      Sydney stares at you, flushed from ear to ear. "Y-you actually came over here? We shouldn't... not in the confessional..." <<He>> reaches for
        your hand despite <<his>> protest, drawing you onto the bench beside <<him>>. "But please don't leave."
    <<else>>
      Sydney glances down the corridor, then closes and locks the door. "This is a terrible place for this," <<he>> murmurs, making room for you
        beside <<him>>. The moment you sit, <<he>> leans in and kisses you.
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你离开自己的隔间，悄悄关上沉重的门。确认走廊里没有人后，你打开另一扇门，进入悉尼所在的告解员一侧。
    <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
      悉尼在你身后锁上门，随即把你拉到狭窄的长椅上。“你特意绕过来，就是为了诱惑自己的告解员？”<<He>>咧嘴一笑，将手探进你的衣服里。“继续吧，挚爱。
        把剩下的罪也全都袒露出来。”
    <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
      悉尼盯着你，脸一直红到耳根。“你、你真的过来了？我们不应该……不能在告解室里……”尽管嘴上抗议，<<he>>仍伸手握住你，把你牵到身旁坐下。
        “但请别离开。”
    <<else>>
      悉尼朝走廊看了一眼，随后关门落锁。“这里实在不适合做这种事。”<<he>>低声说道，在身旁为你让出位置。你刚坐下，<<he>>便凑过来吻住了你。
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<br><br>

<<lanLink 'Continue' 'Temple Confess Self Sydney Sex'>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</lanLink>><br>
